@zero_television_2026
# prose-audit: Grade A — Stanowski and Duda are introduced through their media and political roles, the prior relationship shapes the dilemma, and engagement, institution-building and boycott each land differently. One copy-edit outstanding: the federated-network branch ends on a sentence fragment ("A quarrel among regional barons over whose programme gets the best slot.").
title: Kanał Zero becomes a television channel
subtitle: Stanowski turns an online audience into a broadcaster and gives Duda a studio after the Palace
