[? if left_in_government and equality_minister_party = "Lewica": Equality
Minister **[+ equality_minister +]** convenes the responsible registry, health
and justice offices around an implementation brief for the day after a
signature. The equality portfolio coordinates; each competent minister still
signs that office's own order. Nothing is issued as law yet, but the cabinet
can no longer claim it was surprised.?]
[? if left_in_government and equality_minister_party != "Lewica": Kotula puts
an implementation checklist before coalition council. The ministers who own
the registry, health and justice files agree to prepare their orders; Lewica
can enforce that cabinet commitment politically, but cannot sign another
party's instructions.?]
[? if not left_in_government: Lewica publishes the implementation checklist
that it expects the cabinet to follow after a signature. From opposition, the
party can make a promise administratively credible; it cannot order a single
office to carry it out.?]

PSL can defend the vote as a bounded compromise. Equality organisations welcome
the protection and warn that Lewica has accepted less than equal marriage.

- @poland_event_queue: Convene the implementation brief

@partnership_pressure
title: Call it a floor and introduce marriage equality next
subtitle: Let Kotula file the larger bill immediately, forcing every partner to say whether the compromise was a beginning or a ceiling.
view-if: partnership_sejm_passed = 1
on-arrival: progressive_credibility += 6; psl_relation -= 9; government_coalition_dissent += 6; president_relation -= 4; far_right_agenda += 4; public_mood_pending_lgbt_equality_support += 11; public_mood_pending_lgbt_equality_salience += 8; public_mood_pending_lgbt_equality_backlash += 8; news_headline = "The compromise becomes the first stage of a larger equality fight"

Before the presidential ink can dry, Kotula files a marriage-equality bill and
calls the partnership statute the first protection won, not the final status
owed. Kosiniak-Kamysz accuses Lewica of turning a negotiated settlement into a
trap. The far right seizes on the new text, but nobody can now sell the limited
bill as the end of the argument.

- @poland_event_queue: File the marriage bill

@partnership_palace
