@partnership_failed_rollcall
title: Publish every dissenting vote and organise the constituencies
subtitle: Carry the division list into the districts where deputies called a quiet abstention harmless.
view-if: partnership_sejm_passed = 0
on-arrival: media_capacity += 3; local_network += 3; progressive_credibility += 3; psl_relation -= 6; public_trust += 1; news_headline = "The failed partnership vote follows dissenting deputies home"

Local organisers pair every abstention with the hospital visit, tenancy or
inheritance case the bill would have covered. Deputies who expected the vote to
vanish into a Warsaw ledger meet it again at constituency surgeries. The bill
is still defeated; what changes is the price of forgetting how each member
voted.

- @poland_event_queue: Print the division list

@partnership_failed_bargain
