Q.news_headline =
    "The Left prices its defence votes in indexation and wages";
!}

The offer is public and specific: our votes for the financing act, and beside
it a statutory indexation floor, a public-sector wage rule and a written
refusal to reopen the retirement age. Whoever wants the ammunition contracts
signs the annex first.

It works because nobody can pretend we arrived at the subject this morning. In
2023 the referendum asked whether Poland should raise the retirement age and
most of the opposition told voters to leave the ballot in the hall; we answered
it. Three years of being the party that took that question seriously is what
makes the price credible now, and the right pays part of it rather than
explain to garrison towns why the annex was refused.

- @poland_event_queue: Publish the annex

@safe_veto_campaign
title: Accept the block and campaign on who left the army waiting
subtitle: Concedes the programme for a year and takes the defence-competence argument to the right's own voters.
on-arrival: safe_veto_response = "Campaign on the block"; defence_readiness -= 3; left_poll_momentum += 0.2; social_patriot_support += 6; rural_support += 2; president_relation -= 9; pis_relation -= 8; public_trust += 1; eu_relations -= 2; public_mood_pending_national_security_support += 8; public_mood_pending_national_security_left_ownership += 7; news_headline = "The Left takes the vetoed defence programme into the right's constituencies"

We stop negotiating and start touring: the garrison towns, the plants that
hired against these contracts, the counties where the army is the largest
employer. The message is one sentence — the Palace stopped the money — and it
is delivered by us rather than by the coalition's liberal wing.

The programme stays blocked for the year. What we gain is the first defence
argument the Left has been able to make in those towns since 2015, and the
right's monopoly on the subject weakens in exactly the places the 2027
campaign will be decided.

- @poland_event_queue: Take the defence argument on tour
